successfully.",Zf="By reduce AP{index}",Xf="T6 Longsword",$f="Sign In",ek="Don't have an account? Sign up",sk="Purchase a subscription for +{days} days ({sum} ₽)",tk="<Text>The new calculation method will upgrade 1 large attribute (with crowns) every 8 small attributes (books only).</Text> <Text>The old calculation method (if you turn this option off) will upgrade all small attributes first, and only then large ones.</Text>",ak="2 stars",ok="Barracks Calculator",nk="Desired castle level",rk="Spine",lk="Accept the agreement",ck="Subscribe",ik="Ruby T10",uk="Total points for <Red>Boss</Red> wave:",dk="T10 Staff",gk="Ruby T5",mk="Section for customizing your heroes, as well as distributing free-pick heroes cards. If you want to use the advanced hero calculation mode, then this section will be mandatory to fill out. Unfortunately, due to the large number of heroes, as well as the not very indicative hero interface in the game, filling out this section can take a long time. I tried to simplify the filling as much as possible.",Ak="Ruby T3",pk="Halo Forge Blueprint T10",hk="T",xk="The most important section, which contains subsections - individual calculators. I recommend that you familiarize yourself with each of them separately. Some of them are ready to provide you with additional auxiliary information based on the results of calculations. For example, the dragon calculator will tell you how many free-pick boxes to open to get a particular rune.",jk="Tavern (stat recruitment)",bk="Gallery shard",yk="Jade Dragon Heart T1",vk="Regeneration",wk="T6 Longbow",fk="Maximum values ​​in each rank:",kk="T3 Ice Wizard EXP Book",_k="Imperial Sword T5",Mk="Magic Dust T11",Tk="T9 Dagger",Ck="Cookie and Analytics Policy",Bk="Blacksmith",Sk="Consider the castle level when upgrading your dragon",Ik="There is no information on the wave power for this level.",Rk="March speed",Dk="Thunder Forge Blueprint T9",Pk="Points per person (simple waves):",Ek="Calculations are available if you have an active subscription.",Qk="Monster Counter",qk="T4 Longsword",Fk="Cerulean Dragon Horns T2",Nk="19th wave",Gk="Attention! Don't forget to set the correct <link>server settings</link> for your profile that you added from the game",zk="Level: {oldLevel} {arrow} {newLevel}",Kk="Overseer",Vk="Presets",Lk="SR heroes cards",Hk="Spent resources",Wk="Castle",Uk="Frostice Dragon Horns T13",Yk="Victory Bow T12",Ok="Forge Hammer",Jk="Select the character profile for which you want to import data from the game.",Zk="The number of points required to unlock a level in the Evil Spirits Invasion event",Xk="Follow these three simple steps to import the data.",$k="Inventory",e_="Blueprint: Blaze Armor T11",s_="Barracks + Talents",t_="Calculators",a_="Spent free-pick cards: {value}",o_="The {button} button will automatically distribute the free-pick heroes cards to upgrade as many stars as possible for your heroes. The button will stop when no one can raise a new star with the remaining number of free-pick heroes cards.",n_="I decided to develop my own version of the calculator and make it a web version for several reasons:",r_="By elements",l_="Use Custom Construction boxes?",c_="Blaze Dragon Heart T11",i_="Alliance members count",u_="Importing the data will clear all the data entered manually earlier in the calculator!",d_="Converting Free-Pick Dragon runes boxes",g_="Import data from the game",m_="T12 Magic Book",A_="T5 Longsword",p_="Ruby T6",h_="Troops power",x_="T10 Longbow",j_="T2 Flame Mage EXP Book",b_="The calculator is divided into several sections. Each of them has its own purpose, so you should not always neglect them.",y_="Academy of Technology",v_="Magic Longbow T4",w_="Saved!",f_="For your convenience, there are three buttons: MAX points, MAX stars and Reset",k_="T13 Longbow",__="For bar:",M_="Season {season}",T_="T4 Staff",C_="In this mode, the calculation of hero points is based on separately entered hero parameters, as well as the distribution of free-pick heroes cards.",B_="T2 Longsword",S_="Inspiration",I_="Reset password",R_="Duel - Summon Altar",D_="Barracks and Talents",P_="Accrued +{days} days",E_="Sign Up",Q_="INN: <Text span>593306502526</Text>",q_="Blueprint: Legendary Armor T5",F_="Magic Dust T8",N_="What happens if the subscription ends?",G_="Blueprint: Immortal Armor T4",z_="4-100th",K_="The calculator is being developed without any targeted support, solely through my efforts and solely at my request.",V_="Rare Dragon Rune",L_="Fortune Potion",H_="This section can be ignored if you are going to use the simplified hero calculation mode. In this case, you need to manually fill in the number of hero cards for each rank in the inventory. They can also be filled in the hero calculator",W_="Saving",U_="Netherfrost Dragon Heart T12",Y_="Darkiron Longbow T2",O_="Legendary Emblem",J_="Input hero name...",Z_="Archer",X_="{place} (season {season})",$_="User Agreement",eM="Power of Flame Mage",sM="If you did not see the letter in your mailbox, please check your Spam folder. Sometimes the letter ends up there.",tM="Do you really want to import the data from the game to the calculator?",aM="The calculator will help you prepare for the event, see and calculate how strong the spirits will be summoned at a given level. It will also allow you to see how many points your alliance and each player individually will be able to earn at this event.",oM="Victory Forge Blueprint T12",nM="For bar fill{index}",rM="The {button} button will perform a complete reset of the self-selection card distribution.",lM="The inventory section contains all the necessary resources required for the Ultimate Power and Alliance Duel events. These resources will also be displayed in the calculators, but only those that are necessary for calculations in the calculator itself. In this section, you can fill in all the resources you have at once. Alternatively, you can do this separately in each calculator.",cM="T12 Staff",iM="Magic Dust T6",uM="Perfect Summoning Spell",dM="Pumpkin Catapult T7",gM="Attention!",mM="T13 Staff",AM="Equipments Calculator",pM="Advanced Summoning Spell",hM="T7 Magic Book",xM="Heart",jM="T11 Longbow",bM="Blood of Titan",yM="Eternal Forge Blueprint T11",vM="Accurate point calculation - no guesswork or extra spending. Your weekly plan is in the Kingdom Guard Calculator",wM="Error saving!",fM="Duel - Hero",kM="By skills",_M="Blueprint: Frostice Dragon Armor T13",MM="T8 Longsword",TM="This preset will show SSR heroes you can obtain in the Crazy Roulette that haven't yet reached 5 stars. They will be sorted by the number of cards required to reach a star.",CM="No changes",BM="Power: {power}",SM="<Text>For the most effective upgrading, it is better not to spend talent books and crowns on those elements that are not the main ones, since this will not give an effective increase in power.</Text> <Text>However, if this is not so important, and you also want to score more points in events, it makes sense to spend resources on other elements.</Text> <Text>Resources will be spent in the order of elements, as they go in the barracks (or indicated in the calculator). But first of all, resources will be spent on the priority element.</Text>",IM="Spent:",RM="To customize your heroes and distribute your free-pick heroes cards, please visit the page",DM="Dark Dragon Heart T7",PM="Excellent Dragon Rune",EM="Rank {rank}:",QM="Points to unlock level {level}:",qM="Password",FM="Blueprint: Balrog Armor T6",NM="Connecting...",GM="Delete profile",zM="T1 Archer EXP Book",KM="T6 Staff",VM="Ultimate Hunting Points",LM="Horns",HM="Magic Dust T5",WM="Spend the rest of the EXP Books on an artifact",UM="Kingstar Dragon Heart T10",YM="Total points for <Purple>Elite</Purple> waves:",OM="Telegram group: {anchor}",JM="Legendary Forge Blueprint T5",ZM="In this section, you can adjust the key parameters for your server if your server is earlier or later than mine. You can also adjust the number of points earned in Alliance Duel and Ultimate Power events.",XM="Blueprint: Gilded Armor T8 ",$M="A Telegram bot that lets you view a map of a lava cave. Works within TG groups.",eT="Converting resources",sT="Converting castle resources?",tT="Perfect Dragon Rune",aT="Offline Gold",oT="Your current subscription is valid until {until}",nT="On this page, you can set up the auto-import of your game data to the calculator.",rT="Silver Emblem",lT="If you have not received the activation email, please make sure you have entered the correct email address. Otherwise, please contact me directly: {email}",cT="Jade Dragon Horns T1",iT="Demonic Dragon Heart T3",uT="Show",dT="Forgot password",gT="Legendary Longbow T5",mT="3 stars",AT="Also, <a>here</a> you can see detailed information on the level you need",pT="Distribution of free-pick heroes cards",hT="My dragons emblems",xT="Perfect Forge Blueprint T3",jT="Subscription Settings",bT="Feathered Guardian T11",yT="Witch",vT="Magic Dust T9",wT="Forge Blueprint T13",fT="About calculator",kT="Invalid email",_T="T2 Longbow",MT="Farewell",TT="You will keep all your data. Advanced calculations will no longer be available until you renew. Basic data entry and game synchronization will remain free forever.",CT="Subscription",BT="Add new profile",ST="Ruby T13",IT="Before we start calculating, please take a few minutes to read this text. I want to briefly tell you about the calculator and how to use it.",RT="Settings",DT="Spend excess light reagents on an artifact",PT="T13 Longsword",ET="<b>Access from any device</b> — the website can be conveniently accessed on both a phone and a PC. No need to carry an Excel file around",QT="Using this import tool, you act at your own risk! The administration of this website is not responsible for your game account and for your game characters!",qT="T10 Longsword",FT="Enough points to open a new level",NT="Not connected",GT="BL Store Coefficients",zT="Ruby T11",KT="Dragons Armor",VT="Dragons Armors Calculator",LT="Rare Forge Blueprint T1",HT="14th Elite Wave",WT="Seasons",UT="The number of the kingdom you are playing on. For example: 1150, 1570, 2020",YT="0 stars",OT="Tail",JT="1st",ZT="Blueprint: Iceflame Armor T9",XT="I <Link>agree to the Personal Data Processing Policy</Link> and <LinkTerms>User Agreement</LinkTerms>",$T="Have an account? Sign In",e2="Only the necessary game data from your character will be imported to the calculator, namely:",s2="To continue using our site, you must accept these policies.",t2="<b>Data saving</b> - All your parameters are saved in the profile. One-click synchronization with the game (free even without an Subscription)",a2="Armored Shark T2",o2="4 stars",n2="In some cases, errors in the power of the 19th wave were noticed. In the game, the power of the 19th wave may be slightly more/less than indicated in the calculator.",r2="Blueprint: Demonic Armor T3",l2="T1 Staff",c2="- It's convenient.",i2="Required resources",u2="T3 Dagger",d2="<Text>Attention! The user, as well as all data associated with him, will be permanently deleted.</Text><b>This action is irreversible!</b>",g2="Privacy policy",m2="Scales",A2="History",p2="Apply",h2="If you do not agree with these policies, or do not want us to continue processing your personal data (only your Email), then you can delete your account in <Link>profile settings</Link>.",x2="Guerrilla Master",j2="Dragons runes",b2="Reduced AP costs for monsters",y2="{type} T{rank}",v2="Bronze Rune Level Limit",w2="Set a new password",f2="Ruby T9",k2="Equips (Thursday)",_2="New password",M2="According to the User Agreement, the service is considered to be fully provided from the moment of Subscription activation on your account. No refunds are possible after activation. Please read the terms carefully before purchasing.",T2="Immortal Dragon Horns T4",C2="Free-pick heroes cards",B2="If the data on the site is not displayed up-to-date, try refreshing the page or re-login in to the site.",S2="T5 Magic Book",I2="Gathering Master",R2="My resources and parameters",D2="Resources spent",P2="Parameters of evil spirits",E2="Used {icon}: {value}",Q2="The fourth step is to select your gaming profile in the header of the site to view the data and calculate events points.",q2="Are you sure you want to delete profile {profileName}?",F2="Calculate",N2="Calculator settings",G2="T9 Staff",z2="Light Magic power",K2="Parameters",V2="I have a question, where should I go?",L2="<Text>All resources will be spent on upgrading the artifact instead of upgrading the dragon.</Text> <Text>Available only starting from dragon level 28.</Text> <Text>It is worth considering that if the castle calculating settings are enabled, then the resources will first be spent on upgrading the dragon until it reaches the castle level limit. And only when the limit is reached, all remaining resources will be spent on the artifact.</Text> <Text>If the castle calculating settings are not enabled, all resources will be spent on upgrading the artifact.</Text>",H2="By bars",W2="Lava Cave Bot",U2="Iceflame Dragon Horn T9",Y2="Magic Dust T4",O2="My castle",J2="Head",Z2="An email with instructions on how to recover your password has been sent to {email}.",X2="Other",$2="Confirm password",eC="Golden Emblem",sC="Skills",tC="First Aid",aC="Consent to the processing of personal data",oC="Perfect Summoning Spell (Recycled)",nC="Crazy Roulette",rC="No data",lC="Is it safe?",cC="Opened fragments",iC="T3 Archer EXP Book",uC="Sort heroes by stars",dC="Dragons calculator",gC="Master Talents Books for every 1 T3 EXP Book",mC="Dragon Soul Stone",AC="<Text>All remaining EXP books (including free-pick EXP books) will be spent on the artifact to gain MK/UP points</Text> <Text>It is possible to spend EXP books on the artifact only when all elements are upgraded up to rank 9.</Text> <Text>It is worth considering that first EXP books will be exchanged for talent books (if the corresponding setting is enabled), and only then the remains will be spent on the artifact.</Text>",pC="T6 Dagger",hC="Can I get a refund?",xC="Attention! Advanced hero scoring mode enabled",jC="Master Talent Books for every 1 T2 EXP book",bC="Total cards:",yC="Change password",vC="Rewards in the Alliance Duel event",wC="Crimson Dragon T8",fC="Alliance Duel",kC="Hello! Our site has updated the following policies:",_C="Edit profile",MC="Load capacity",TC="INN: <text>593306502526</text>",CC="T2 Staff",BC="Magic Dust T13",SC="Duel - Blacksmith",IC="Levels to upgrade: {count}",RC="The level of the castle I want",DC="The power of waves",PC="10th Boss wave",EC="Demonic Dragon Horns T3",QC="Crazy Roulette (Event)",qC="Alliance Duel Calculator",FC="Using dragon rune boxes?",NC="Blueprint: Jade Armor T1",GC="By season{index}",zC="T2 Goblin EXP Book",KC="Total required",VC="Kingdom INFO",LC="Dragon",HC="Hide 5 star heroes",WC="Revenant Armor T9",UC="Change Equip",YC="Reject",OC="Back",JC="Select the game profiles to synchronize with the calculator profiles.",ZC="By hero name{index}",XC="Dragon Emblems + Dragon Armor",$C="20th Boss wave",e3="Luxurious Longbow T7",s3="Master Talents Books for every 1 T4 EXP Book",t3="KG Companion is a game companion for finding characters and viewing their historical power in the game Kingdom Guard.",a3="Subscription for 30 days - 990₽",o3="The first step: log in to your gaming account.",n3="100 AP",r3="Take future upgrading",l3="Ultimate Power points",c3="T14 Magic Book",i3="We use cookies to collect anonymous statistics in order to improve the site. More details in <Link>Cookies and analytics policy</Link>.",u3="The Duel Alliance and Ultimate Power calculators contain summarized results from all other calculators. They are used to view the total number of points you can earn from these events.",d3="Max Bronze Emblem level",g3="Not enough {diff} points to open a new level",m3="Successfully connected",A3="Accept",p3="Iceflame Dragon Heart T9",h3="Imported",x3="Fortune Roulette",j3="Heroes Table",b3="Points required",y3="By place of receipt",v3="Advanced calculation of Heroes",w3="By stars count",f3="Rank",k3="Summon Altar",_3="Heroes (Saturday)",M3="Rapid March",T3="Filter heroes",C3="K",B3="Evil Spirits",S3="Master Talents books for every 1 EXP Book ",I3='If you have a lot of free-pick heroes cards, this button will not spend them all. It will distribute the cards where necessary, for "maximum squeeze", and you can distribute the remaining cards yourself at your discretion. There will be no difference in points.',R3="Common",D3="M",P3="Flame Mage",E3="T1 Goblin EXP Book",Q3="Magic Dust T3",q3="Bots",F3="By Rank",N3="<Text>Based on your resources and parameters, the maximum castle level that can be upgraded will be determined.</Text> <Text>Next, this maximum castle level will be used as a limit when upgrading the dragon and calculating points.</Text> <Text>If this setting is disabled, the current castle level specified in the parameters will be taken into account.</Text>",G3="Magic Dust T10",z3="<Text>You can only exchange books for talents when the element has reached its maximum rank.</Text> <Text>If, for example, the fire element is upgraded to the maximum, you can only exchange fire books for talent books.</Text>",K3="Filters",V3="New profile",L3="T9 Longbow",H3="Summoning Altar Calculator",W3="The account was successfully registered!",U3="Ruby T1",Y3="T11 Longsword",O3="Big Icons",J3="Duel - Unit Evolution",Z3="T4 Goblin EXP Book",X3="R rank",$3="Last opened witch gems rank",eB="Heroes",sB="Heroes cards",tB="This tool for importing data to the calculator is not official, and in theory may lead to temporary/permanent blocking of your character and/or account!",aB="Recovered Troops",oB="I agree to the <link>Offer</link> and <linkPrivacy>Personal Data Processing Policy</linkPrivacy>",nB="Reason for creation",rB="User activation",lB="Bronze Emblem",cB="Duel - Hero Gear",iB="Thunder Bow T9",uB="Academy",dB="Balrog Dragon Heart T6",gB="T5 Longbow",mB="T9 Longsword",AB="Magic Dust T1",pB='<Text>Free-pick EXP books will be exchanged for books of the selected element that you want to upgrade in the first priority.</Text> <Text>If the element is upgraded to the maximum, and the parameter "Exchange excess barracks books for talents" is not enabled, Free-pick EXP books will not be used.</Text>',hB="<Text>All excess forge hammers will be spent on the artifact.</Text> <Text>Only available starting from forge level 2000.</Text>",xB="Сезон {season} >>",jB="T11 Dagger",bB="Spent excess forge hammers to artifact",yB="Tavern (Normal recruitment)",vB="11-50",wB="Calculator",fB="Missing",kB="This section will help you customize the calculator for you. The fact is that all servers in the game are at different stages of development. Because of this, some may already have later ranks and heroes open, while newer servers have very few open yet. The standard settings of the calculator are tailored for the server grid 1491-1577, for the reason that the developer himself plays in this server grid.",_B="T1 Longsword",MB="Bow T13",TB="Total spent",CB="Claws",BB="The user has been successfully activated. Now you can Sign In to the site using your login and password.",SB="Reset",IB="Offline Gold",RB="BL Throne Rewards",DB="The third step: import the data from the game for the character (profile)",PB="Legendary Dragon Horns T5",EB="King's Bow T8",QB="4-10",qB="T8 Longbow",FB="Gallery level",NB="Ruby T12",GB="Equips",zB="T3 Flame Mage EXP Book",KB="Subscription on Kingdom Guard Calculator",VB='Count talents and crowns "1 through 8"',LB="This calculator is not one of the main ones, it is needed for a separate event - Invasion of Evil Spirits.",HB="T3 Staff",WB="Password length must be 8 characters or more",UB="Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)",YB="Crown of the Oracle",OB="Blood of Titan (Recycled)",JB="The subscription is not active!",ZB="Season",XB="Where you can get",$B="Are we changing the free-pick EXP Books into a priority element?",eS="Create profile",sS="If you are absolutely sure that you want to delete the user, then enter <Text>CONFIRM</Text> in the field below.",tS="Sign In",aS="Archery Master",oS="SSR Hero Cards",nS="Frostice Dragon Heart T13",rS="5 AP",lS="T2 Magic Book",cS="T3 Magic Book",iS="Castle Calculator",uS="Wave {waveNumber}",dS="Profile and settings",gS="For convenience, you can, but do not have to, use the character's nickname in the game",mS="T8 Magic Book",AS="Dragons Armor (Friday)",pS="I would be glad to receive your feedback, suggestions, questions and comments on the calculator.",hS="<b>Resource-saving</b> - You know exactly whether to go to the event this week or better to save further. No more wasted resources!",xS="Your current subscription has expired {until}",jS="Blueprint: Dark Armor T7",bS="T12 Longsword",yS="Spend dragon resources on artifact",vS="No profile",wS="Balrog Dragon Horns T6",fS="T5 Dagger",kS="Password changed successfully!",_S="Display",MS="Elemental Vial",TS="N Hero Cards",CS="T1 Ice Wizard EXP Book",BS="<b>Log in</b> on the website (or register if you don't have an account yet)",SS="Deluxe Dragon Soul Stone",IS="Magic Dust T14",RS="T10 Magic Book",DS="Recovery speed",PS="Renew your subscription",ES="On this page you can distribute free-pick cards between heroes.",QS="For star:",qS="Immortal Dragon Heart T4",FS="Profile Name",NS="Duel Expert 2",GS="My heroes upgrading",zS="Select season",KS="Take upgrading",VS="Number of Kingdom (Server)",LS="Deluxe Dragon Soul Stone (Recycled)",HS="Current password",WS="Update Profile",US="Priority element:",YS="Blaze Expert",OS="AP Calculator",JS="Gold Gathering",ZS="Dragon Level",XS="7th Elite Wave",$S="Spent cards:",eI="This site uses cookie technology.",sI="Profile settings",tI="R Hero Cards",aI="Panda Traveler T12",oI="Lvl: {level}",nI="Spend all resources on artifact instead of upgrading castle",rI="- It's fast.",lI="T1 Dagger",cI="Summon Altar (Tuesday)",iI="Duel - Unit Talent",uI="Silverine Bow T3",dI="Waves Power for each level of the Evil Spirits Invasion event",gI="Broken Land Gold",mI="Exchange rate of EXP Books for Master Talent Books in the exchange shop",AI="Elemental Vial (Recycled)",pI="Consider the possible castle level when upgrading your dragon",hI="VIP",xI="How does this work?",jI="Blacksmith Level",bI="Strengthening Potion",yI="Magic Dust T7",vI="The subscription is active!",wI="Gallery (Monday, Wednesday, Friday)",fI="Server settings",kI="Gallery",_I="Blaze Dragon Horns T11",MI="Wishing Crystal Ball",TI="T1 Flame Mage EXP Book",CI="Importing game data",BI="An error has occurred",SI="I would like to point out that I am making the calculator primarily for myself, as well as for my alliance friends. Therefore, it is in my interests to make it as convenient and easy to use as possible.",II="King's Forge Blueprint T8",RI="Ruby T7",DI="If you make changes to your resources or settings, the data on this page will be automatically recalculated when you return here.",PI="T8 Dagger",EI="Archer Power",QI="While it is quite convenient to fill in Excel tables on a PC, it is not so pleasant to do this on mobile devices. The web version of the calculator is more convenient both when working with a PC and from mobile devices",qI="Telegram group",FI="Level ",NI="Ruby T4",GI="Sand Reaper T10",zI="Alliance Duel Points",KI='The {button} will automatically distribute the self-selection cards so that to "squeeze" the maximum out of your heroes, and to score the most possible points on the Alliance Duel/Ultimate Power. Simply put - uses the maximum possible number of cards.',VI="Wave",LI="Custom Construction Item",HI="Results",WI="Sign Out",UI="An unexpected error has occurred",YI="Netherfrost Dragon Horns T12",OI="Points per person (elite waves):",JI="Passwords must match",ZI="Reducing AP",XI="Gallery Calculator",$I="Blueprint: Cerulean Armor T2",e4="What do you get?",s4="Resource exchange",t4="Witch + Gems",a4="Line by line",o4="Profile name must be between 2 and 20 characters.",n4="Cancel",r4="B",l4="T12 Longbow",c4="By regeneration{index}",i4="Bounty Hall",u4="Add",d4="Points",g4="Rank: {oldRank} {arrow} {newRank}",m4={"+65WKv":"Count","+BP9vF":"By recovery speed{index}","+ESeH2":"Auto-renewal is disabled","+RTx65":"Gold","+fXgil":"Your profile data will be lost forever.","+fwVgn":"<b>Click «Calculate»</b> - and get an accurate prediction of your points based on all your resources and settings","+hfS0b":"Cancel subscription","+mDIXI":"You have: {value} AP","+r2KmS":"T13 Magic Book","+su5+K":"T7 Longbow","+tjAID":"Duel - Dragon Gear","/+DM0T":"You should receive a letter at {email} with instructions for activating your account.","/8OAc0":"Total:","/AKSM/":"Rainbow Pony T3","/FdIJ5":"Legendary Dragon Heart T5","/H63fp":"Duel - Witch Potion","/He8ej":"Hero","/L4E98":"T13 Dagger","/N2H4C":"When new heroes are added to the game, or when points are updated in Alliance Duel/Ultimate Power events, you can simply update everything yourself in the web app. The developer (i.e., me) will add the new heroes.","/SsdaP":"T7 Longsword","/Ygfhs":"Game Data Import","/aMBeQ":"The latest open talent rank in the barracks","/bq2xb":"Luxurious Blueprint T7","/lNy72":"Dark Magic power","/mPhVB":"Current upgrades","0+Fc3B":"Owner: <text>Telitsa Vladislav Elmirovich</text>","0OkJX5":"Change password","0PyqOA":"For each rank, you must specify the number of filled attributes.","0RnfsN":"Barracks","0T662u":"Valid until {date}","0XFEXk":"By hero rank{index}","0a+PIF":"Delete user and data?","0xHkHp":"Refresh","11Vv4+":"Evil Spirits Invasion","14sVnM":"Ruby T14","15ueKs":"Resource","18bpL8":"Steel","1KWTkA":"Offline Gold","1LgrxR":"Synchronize profiles","1Ny7pd":"Exchange Shop Coefficients","1PaPOJ":"N rank","1aUjnQ":"Partners","1aq+pW":"Free-pick heroes cards:","1f6tXA":"By load{index}","1g6yXS":"Dragon Soul Stone (Recycled)","1hMCrW":"20 AP","1lC6JR":"Dragon Armors Upgrade:","28+Lem":"Terms of service","28ZehW":"Subscription ended {date}!","2DAhRs":"Sign up","2GppX9":"T3 Longbow","2Jxk80":"Current season","2WTbIX":"Open","2dPaj8":"Points for all members","30q/K9":"Evil Spirit Invasion Calculator","31Rdzm":'You can "combine" these buttons by pressing first one, then the second, in any order. Or you can use only one of them, and distribute the remaining free-pick cards yourself, at your discretion.',"32aQl3":"Upgraded: {value}","3iPhOe":"Cards left:","49tBUC":"Master Talent Book","4AOPP3":"Tavern (Advanced recruitment)","4F/yEy":"T5 Staff","4MRDaq":"Dragon Runes (Tuesday, Friday)","4UrdkD":"Sort heroes","4iNsAY":"Duel Expert 1","4nmjfl":"Sorting","4qQxs1":"Small attribute","4rz7mA":"Healing","4vvn4c":"Rank {rank}","4vxGze":"Total points:","4zttbq":"Free-Pick Unit EXP Book","5+PkyL":"T4 Ice Wizard EXP Book","51bpe+":"By available cards{index}","51go96":"Blacksmith + Forge Equipment","57EMyH":"My resources","59M5NF":"Beasts in Dimensional Store","5FKxqu":"Blacksmith Calculator","5Fq+qW":"The profile name must be at least 2 characters long.","5O3r+7":"200 AP","5OR6xi":"MAX points","5RY0i1":"In this section, similar to the inventory, all the necessary parameters for calculating events are presented. You can fill them all at once on this page, or fill them separately in each calculator.","5VanSI":"Equip Level","5aBtHI":"Witch Calculator","5hcyGl":"Magic Dust T2","5iWqsM":"Stone","5mdSZy":"SSR rank","5pbCKQ":"Eternal Bow T11","5tnJNP":"T12 Dagger","5uie+x":"T8 Staff","5yueuT":"Other - Evil Spirits Invasion Calculator","65yhzT":"Yes. Payment goes through the certified Robokassa payment gateway (license of the Central Bank of the Russian Federation). We do not store and do not process your bank card details - it does the payment gateway.","6AIV16":"1st","6B+D83":"Import","6DyGho":"Error","6HHCRO":"The number of cards is taken from the game screen with a list of all heroes (the number is indicated there with +1 mandatory card). If there is no hero available, we set 0 cards.","6IWe08":"The second step: synchronize your character (profile) from the game by adding it to the calculator.","6MN